@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 120
hide footbox
title Allpatek | Agreement signature and parcel production
actor Merchant
actor Farmer
participant "Angular SPA" as Web
participant "Agreements / REST" as Rest
participant "Profiles / current account" as Acct
participant "Agreement service and JPA adapter" as Repo
participant "Parcels / event handler" as Parcels
Merchant -> Web : Accept terms for a parcel
Web -> Rest : POST /api/v1/agreements (bearer, ROLE_MERCHANT)
Rest -> Acct : Resolve profile ID and full name
Rest -> Repo : SaveAgreementCommand (resource fallback for missing identity)
Repo --> Web : AgreementResource via controller
Farmer -> Web : Accept the request
Web -> Rest : POST /api/v1/agreements/{id}/farmer-signature\nBearer, ROLE_FARMER
Rest -> Repo : SignFarmerCommand; look up agreement
alt Agreement absent
  Repo --> Web : Not found via controller
else Agreement found
  Repo -> Repo : Save withFarmerSignature(); compare previous signatures
  opt First transition to fully signed
    Repo -> Repo : AgreementFullySignedEvent → integration event
    Repo -> Parcels : AgreementFullySignedIntegrationEvent
    Parcels -> Parcels : MarkParcelInProductionCommand
    note right of Parcels : A failed command is logged.
  end
  Rest --> Web : Updated agreement
end
note over Web,Rest : Both flags are also accepted on generic writes.\nThe intended acceptance is an application action; a certified signature is planned.
@enduml
